/home/toolchain/development/libc++_replacement/docs/progress/R114/source/base_packages_final_ZH_original.tsv:21:boost	是：ACTUAL_CPP_BUILD_LOG;CPP_RUNTIME_DEPENDENCY;CPP_HEADER_PAYLOAD	直接链接 libstdc++	需要改	`boost` 是被大量项目复用的通用 C++ 库集合（仓库摘要：“Boost C++ Libraries”）。armv7l 的实际 ELF 依赖和符号交集确认，计划切换到 libc++ 的 Unified 侧软件包：`askuser-notification`、`capi-appfw-capmgr`、`cert-svc`、`device-certificate-manager`、`dotnet-launcher`、`key-manager`、`libcryptsvc`、`libphonenumber`、`libwebappenc`、`libzypp`、`security-manager`、`yaca`，在运行时通过 C++ ABI 调用它。其中，`capi-appfw-capmgr`、`cert-svc`、`dotnet-launcher`、`key-manager`、`libwebappenc`、`security-manager` 的边已直接证明会传递布局敏感的标准库类型。`askuser-notification`、`device-certificate-manager`、`libcryptsvc`、`libphonenumber`、`libzypp`、`yaca` 还存在已确认的 C++ ABI 耦合，但现有符号不能进一步证明具体布局传递。若该包继续链接 libstdc++，这些调用会跨越两套标准库；链接器不会阻止这种组合，而对象布局、所有权或析构可能被按错误实现解释，因此必须一并切换。	R100=NEED_LIBCXX/N1_EXACT_CPP_RUNTIME_EDGE；直接libstdc++二进制=boost-atomic;boost-chrono;boost-container;boost-context;boost-contract;boost-coroutine;boost-date-time;boost-fiber;boost-filesystem;boost-graph;boost-iostreams;boost-json;boost-locale;boost-log;boost-math;boost-nowide;boost-program-options;boost-python3;boost-random;boost-regex;boost-serialization;boost-system;boost-test;boost-thread;boost-timer;boost-url;boost-wave;boost_stacktrace;boost_type_erasure；Unified边=CPP_ABI_NO_STD_LAYOUT_PROVEN=6;LAYOUT_SENSITIVE_STD_TYPE=6;OTHER_NO_SYMBOL_INTERSECTION=1；Base内部消费边=CPP_ABI_NO_STD_LAYOUT_PROVEN=1;LAYOUT_SENSITIVE_STD_TYPE=1；VCS=platform/upstream/boost#58b70f335aec5641540dbe04dfd56fad5af43658；Summary=Boost C++ Libraries	是：tizen-boot-aarch64-rpi;tizen-boot-armv7l-rpi;tizen-headed-aarch64;tizen-headed-armv7l;tizen-headless-aarch64;tizen-headless-armv7l	是：产出 boost-test 测试框架子包	已完成并推送（4168e873584ae50a12733262026c007dce18ec89）
